  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAPIDC Africa Air pollution - Evaluations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAPIDC Afrika luftf&#xF6;roreningar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &quot;Regionala luftf&#xF6;roreningar i utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder&quot; (RAPIDC) &#xE4;r ett program koordinerat av Stockholm Environmental Institute (SEI, och som genomf&#xF6;rs i samarbete med svenska institutioner tillsammans med myndigheter och forskningsinstitutioner i Asien och Afrika. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att facilitera utvecklingen av avtal/protokoll f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra &#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder som motverkar och kontrollerar luftf&#xF6;roreningar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Air Pollution in Developing Countries (RAPIDC) is a programme co-ordinated by SEI and carried out in collaboration with Swedish institutions together with inter-governmental agencies and research organisations in Asia and Africa. The aim of RAPIDC is to facilitate the development of agreements/protocols to implement measures which prevent and control air pollution.</narrative>
  </description>
